  "Routing cells the RFC leaves 'by reason', resolved by cited derivation: INVALID_SPEC -> INTEGRATION (§12 checks 2/6/9 + §14); INDETERMINATE(PRECONDITION_ABSENT) at the candidate -> PLAN (§13 PRECONDITION_BROKEN + §14 + §10.2).",
